This repository contains two categories of code:

  1. DJI Sample Code V5 (the `uxsdk/` module and the `dji.sampleV5.*` packages
     under `app/`), which is Copyright (c) 2022 DJI and offered under the MIT
     License reproduced in Section A below.

  2. Original code authored for this project (including the `mission/`, `mqtt/`,
     `safety/`, `dji/`, `config/`, `settings/`, `util/` and `pages/` packages
     under `app/src/main/java/dji/sampleV5/aircraft/`, together with the
     documentation under `docs/`), which is Copyright (c) 2026 kune and is also
     offered under the MIT License reproduced in Section A below.

The DJI Mobile SDK for Android itself is NOT distributed in this repository; it
is resolved as a Maven dependency at build time and is governed by DJI's End User
License Agreement (see Section B). See Section C for the FFmpeg notice.


